qka|v|To go beyond; to proceed beyond the given or supposed limit or measure of; to outgo; to surpass; -- used both in a good and a bad sense; as, one man exceeds another in bulk, stature, weight, power, skill, etc.; one offender exceeds another in villainy; his rank exceeds yours. ; To go too far; to pass the proper bounds or measure. ; To be more or greater; to be paramount.	d:ncc,52,3;1dh4,48,5~1dh4,48,5;ncc,52,3
