r2b|n|The act of exposing or laying open, setting forth, laying bare of protection, depriving of care or concealment, or setting out to reprobation or contempt. ; The state of being exposed or laid open or bare; openness to danger; accessibility to anything that may affect, especially detrimentally; as, exposure to observation, to cold, to inconvenience. ; Position as to points of compass, or to influences of climate, etc. ; The exposing of a sensitized plate to the action of light.	a:1nai,101,9;1ard,64,5;8xb,46,8;1vxz,38,5;171t,36,2;kgh,19,6;1byh,16,12;17p1,15,2;1c8n,7,3~1byh,16,12;1nai,101,9;8xb,46,8;kgh,19,6;1vxz,38,5;1ard,64,5;1c8n,7,3;171t,36,2;17p1,15,2	v:1qze,73,5;11mm,34,3~1qze,73,5;11mm,34,3	n:4we,92,3;28cm,69,9;17p9,45,6;171t,36,2;16eo,33,14;8xb,32,3;16eq,10,1;1m0,8,3;173c,5,5~16eo,33,14;28cm,69,9;17p9,45,6;173c,5,5;1m0,8,3;4we,92,3;8xb,32,3;171t,36,2;16eq,10,1	N:244n,56,18;2447,43,42;1vf8,31,6~2447,43,42;244n,56,18;1vf8,31,6
r2b|v|The act of exposing or laying open, setting forth, laying bare of protection, depriving of care or concealment, or setting out to reprobation or contempt. ; The state of being exposed or laid open or bare; openness to danger; accessibility to anything that may affect, especially detrimentally; as, exposure to observation, to cold, to inconvenience. ; Position as to points of compass, or to influences of climate, etc. ; The exposing of a sensitized plate to the action of light.	o:2447,5,3~2447,5,3	s:16eq,38,7~16eq,38,7
